   371	 * Those were removed when the egress door landed — execution showed the door refuses every payload
   372	 * they caught, and two copies of one case mask each other's tests. The paragraph below describes the
   373	 * historical pairing and is kept for the reasoning, not as a description of the current call graph.
   374	 * The only surviving pre-format call is the tokenless-relay guard, which the door cannot reach.
   375	 *
   376	 * They close
   377	 * different cases — the first refuses a payload that never had content, the second refuses one whose
   378	 * content stopped being reader-visible when the representation changed — and each is proven to red on
   379	 * its own.
