   478	 * it truncated three times. It is transcribed from the Bot API server's own request parser, which is the
   479	 * code that decides what Telegram reads: `Client::get_rich_text`, `Client::get_input_page_block`,
   480	 * `Client::get_page_block_caption`, `Client::get_page_block_table_cell`, `Client::get_input_rich_message`.
   481	 *
   482	 * THE UNION: a bare STRING (the literal), an ARRAY (the sequence), or an OBJECT carrying a `type`
   483	 * discriminator. There is no `texts` key and no `richTextPlain` type value anywhere on the wire — those
