   791	   * cheap change-detector: an unchanged version means the topic's tail content
   792	   * is byte-identical, so the streamer skips serializing it entirely (the
   793	   * 2026-06-05 event-loop-stall fix — building every topic's history every tick
   794	   * blocked the loop for seconds).
