docs/specs/SELF-HEALING-REMEDIATOR-V2-SPEC.eli16.md:7:When Echo breaks, it's usually because the environment shifted underneath it (Homebrew bumped Node, the laptop slept too long, a database file got corrupted mid-write). Each of these has a fix. None of the fixes know about the others. The same problem comes back over and over because nothing remembers we already fixed it ten minutes ago. Two healers can fix the same thing simultaneously and step on each other. A new failure shows up and the only thing that happens is "alert the user" — forever.
