docs/specs/reports/window10-external-passes/pass45-verdict.md:71:9. **Documentation sweep:** still incomplete. The deleted per-sender derivation/ratchet remains current guidance in [the ELI](/Users/justin/window12-exam/docs/specs/telegram-egress-invisible-payload-guard.eli16.md:32), [the convergence report](/Users/justin/window12-exam/docs/specs/reports/telegram-egress-invisible-payload-guard-convergence.md:14), and [the main spec](/Users/justin/window12-exam/docs/specs/telegram-egress-invisible-payload-guard.md:327).
