docs/specs/feature-maturation-recurring-evaluation.eli16.md:7:Missing data is never treated as success. A feature is reported as ready only when every declared metric has enough fresh samples and passes its threshold. Missing contracts, insufficient evidence, stale evidence, failed thresholds, and missed evaluation cadences each have separate visible states. The score is descriptive only: it cannot enable a feature, advance a rollout card, or send a notification.
