docs/specs/prepush-smoke-failed-files-retry.eli16.md:9:The new behavior keeps the first run exactly as useful as before. Vitest still prints its normal output, and the smoke runner still runs the affected set selected by `--changed`. The only addition is that the runner also asks Vitest to write a JSON results file. If the first run passes, nothing else happens.
