docs/specs/PROMISE-BEACON-SPEC.md:38:On 2026-04-18 a multi-round spec convergence review ran for ~35 minutes in topic 7383. Early rounds produced visible output. Then rounds 3–5 ran without agent-facing updates. The user sent "how's it going?" at ~t+32m. From the user's perspective the agent had forgotten them. The work had in fact progressed fine — the silence was the problem, not the work.
