docs/eli16/GEMINI-MODEL-PASSTHROUGH.md:5:The previous Gemini session-launch resolver did that replacement. If the model name was not one of the two verified Gemini names, it quietly swapped the request to the default flash model. That hid mistakes, but it also ignored intentional overrides for newer or experimental Gemini models.
