    61	## The metric's own exclusions, stated because the article ratified today requires it
    62	
    63	This report's counts are **my classification of the reviewer's findings**, not the reviewer's own. It
    64	returned "MINOR ISSUES" on thirteen of fourteen rounds and "SERIOUS ISSUES" once, and that verdict word did
    65	NOT track defect severity — round 6 and round 10 were labelled MINOR and each was a live hole that would
    66	have shipped. **So the headline verdict is the wrong instrument for this series and is reported here only
    67	for completeness.** The design/precision split is the one that carries meaning, and a reader should know it
    68	was applied by the author of the work being reviewed.
    69	
    70	**The question was held constant across all fourteen rounds** — same reviewer family, same brief. By the
